@cudnn-ci-bot run python/sdpa/frost

Updated the dead-row source detector in `67767bad51b474c850eefadc65f614ae0ded1cb5` to match `O_CHUNK_EPI`. The guard, zero-select operation, and scale/select/cast ordering checks remain intact. This resolves the sole failure reported by the SM80, SM100 and SM103 lanes of pipeline 77806342.

Validation: the actual host-only detector function fails before this one-line fix and passes after it; file-scoped pre-commit passes. The kernel file is byte-identical to the previously reviewed and GPU-tested version. No new performance qualification or kernel change is included in this follow-up.

